1Ch 18:1 , David subdues the Philistines and the Moabites;
1Ch 18:3 , He smites Hadarezer and the Syrians;
1Ch 18:9 , Tou sends Hadoram with presents to bless David;
1Ch 18:11 , The presents and the spoil David dedicates to God;
1Ch 18:13 , He puts garrisons in Edom;
1Ch 18:14 , David's officers.
